;＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝
;      基本データ
;＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝＝
; キャラクター基準値の設定
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Data]
life              = 1000
attack            = 100
defence           = 100
power             = 3000
fall.defence_up   = 50
liedown.time      = 60
airjuggle         = 15
sparkno           = -1
guard.sparkno     = 40
KO.echo           = 0
volume            = 255
IntPersistIndex   = ;31,36
FloatPersistIndex = ;60

;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; サイズ指定
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Size]
xscale           = 1
yscale           = 1
ground.back      = 50
ground.front     = 50
air.back         = 50
air.front        = 50
height           = 65
attack.dist      = 140
proj.attack.dist = 90
proj.doscale     = 0
head.pos         = 0,-250
mid.pos          = 0,-125
shadowoffset     = 0

;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 移動速度の設定
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Velocity]
walk.fwd     = 1.3
walk.back    = -1.3
run.fwd      = 4,0
run.back     = -4,0
jump.neu     = 0,-9.15
jump.back    = -1.6
jump.fwd     = 2.4
runjump.back = -2.7,-9.15
runjump.fwd  = 2.7,-9.15

airjump.neu  = 0,-8.0
airjump.back = -1.6,-8
airjump.fwd  = 2.4,-8

;---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 動作の設定
;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Movement]
airjump.num     = 1
airjump.height  = 35
yaccel          = .49
stand.friction  = .90;.85
crouch.friction = .82

;==============================================================================
; 基本動作
;==============================================================================
; 登場
;==============================================================================
; Initialize (at the start of the round)
[Statedef 5900]
type = S

[State 5900, 1] ;Clear all int variables
type = VarRangeSet
trigger1 = roundsexisted = 0
value = 0

[State 5900, 2] ;Clear all float variables
type = VarRangeSet
trigger1 = roundsexisted = 0
fvalue = 0

[State -1] ; 胴体
Type     = Helper
Trigger1 = NumHelper(1000) = 0
Stateno  = 1000
ID       = 1000
Ownpal   = 1
Postype  = P1
Pos      = 0,ifelse(roundsexisted = 0,300,-47)
Keyctrl  = 0
ignorehitpause = 1
[State -1] ; 胴体
Type     = Helper
Trigger1 = NumHelper(1400) = 0
Stateno  = 1400
ID       = 1400
Ownpal   = 1
Postype  = P1
Pos      = 0,0
Keyctrl  = 0
ignorehitpause = 1

[State 5900, 3] ;Intro for round 1
type = ChangeState
trigger1 = roundsexisted = 0
value = 190

